      "rules": "2014",
      "revision": 1
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>武器（长弓），极珍稀（需同调）</em><br />这把弓有着多条弦（弓弦/琴弦），它形如一把里拉琴或一把小号竖琴。你可以在箭矢搭弦时弹奏弦，来为箭矢注入魔法的能量。当你用这把弓发动远程武器攻击时，你可以演奏以下旋律之一。你必须在攻击检定前选择你要演奏的旋律，且你在每次攻击中只能演奏一种旋律。</p><ul style=\"MARGIN:0px auto\"><li><p><strong>精准旋律Melody of Precision。</strong>如果你熟练于表演&amp;Reference[skill=Performance]技能，你的攻击检定将具有+1加值。如果你专精于表演&amp;Reference[skill=Performance]技能，则改为获得+2加值。（原文如此）</p></li><li><strong>回响旋律Melody of Reverberation。</strong>你弹奏出的旋律响彻云霄。命中时，目标将受到等同于你魅力调整值点的额外雷鸣伤害。</li></ul><p>This bow has multiple strings and resembles a lyre or small harp. By strumming the strings while setting an arrow to the bow, you imbue the arrow with magic.</p><p>You can play one of the following melodies when you use the bow to make a ranged weapon attack. You must choose to do so before you make the attack roll, and you can play only one melody per attack.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Melody of Precision\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Melody of Precision.</span> If you're proficient in &amp;Reference[skill=Performance], you gain a +1 bonus to the attack roll. If you have expertise in &amp;Reference[skill=Performance], you gain a +2 bonus instead.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Melody of Reverberation\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Melody of Reverberation.</span> The melody you strum echoes loudly. On a hit, the target takes extra thunder damage equal to your Charisma modifier.</p></div></div>",
